OL,3,GNEWSAPolice safety campaign to test
OL,4,Adrivers' eyesight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has begun conducting
OL,7,Froadside eye tests to raise awareness
OL,8,Fof the minimum eyesight standards when
OL,9,Fdriving.
OL,11,FNorfolk Police said drivers can be
OL,12,Ffined, receive penalty points or
OL,13,Fdisqualification if they fail an
OL,14,Fassessment.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
