OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1794120930
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice safety campaign to test
OL,4,Adrivers' eyesight
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll motorists are required by law to be
OL,7,Fable to read a car number plate from
OL,8,F20m (65ft) away, have 6/12 vision -
OL,9,Fwhen you can read something from 6m
OL,10,F(20ft) away that a person with standard
OL,11,Fsight can read from 12m (40ft) away -
OL,12,Fas well as good central and field
OL,13,Fvision.
OL,15,FAll tests in Norfolk are being carried
OL,16,Fout in daylight conditions, using a
OL,17,Fregistration plate fixed to a vehicle
OL,18,F20m away, the force added.
